        ((genericPoint_spec ↥X).mem_open_set_iff W_X.isOpen).mpr ⟨w₀, trivial, hw₀⟩
      change AlgebraicGeometry.Spec.map (X.presheaf.germ W_X x_gen hx_WX) ≫ hWX.fromSpec =
